# The static app reads only app/public/data/. Skip analysis inputs so
# Vercel does not upload notebooks or the LODES extracts.
# Patterns are anchored with a leading "/" so they match only at the repo
# root. An unanchored "data" also drops app/src/data/ and app/public/data/.
/notebooks
/data
/docs
/scripts
*.ipynb
.DS_Store
/CLAUDE.md
